Package: com.kolby.halo
Name: Halo
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: A Dynamic Island for notch devices. A glass capsule hugs the notch and expands below it for now playing, charging, ringer, Low Power Mode and screen recording. Event-driven, installs no hooks, default off. Stays inert on devices that already have a real Dynamic Island.
Maintainer: ma6x9x
Author: ma6x9x
Section: Tweaks
